.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-system-activate-file 1  "oct-system-activate-file " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-system\-activate\-file \- Activate File (recover from "card terminated" state)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct system activate\-file\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Activate File (recover from "card terminated" state)
.PP
If a card is in "Terminated" state, this command activates it again. Command can only be performed if only one card is connected to the system, and that card is in the terminated state.
.PP
Otherwise an error message is printed.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
